# Line endings: store and check out LF for every text file, on every
# platform.  This overrides core.autocrlf, so the working tree, the index,
# and the repository all agree and Git stops warning about CRLF rewrites.
#
# If a file type ever needs CRLF (e.g. Windows .bat/.cmd scripts), override
# it after the catch-all rule, like this:
#   *.bat text eol=crlf
* text=auto eol=lf
